                <br /><br /> I work across <strong>UI/UX, graphic design, and game development </strong>using <strong>Figma, Canva, and a bit of code </strong> when needed.
                <br /><br /><strong>Welcome to my humble abode! </strong>
            </p>

            <a href="#archive" class="hero-cta">[ View Archive ]</a>
        </section>

        <section id="about" aria-label="About me">
            <div class="section-label">// ABOUT_ME.TXT</div>

            <div class="archive-row">
                <div class="row-key">Name</div>
                <div class="row-val">Zyrah Mae M. Dotollo (Zyzy)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="archive-row">
                <div class="row-key">Role</div>
                <div class="row-val">Student + UI/UX and Graphic Designer + Developer</div>
            </div>
            <div class="archive-row">
                <div class="row-key">Based</div>
                <div class="row-val">Somewhere in Metro Manila! :P</div>
            </div>
            <div class="archive-row">
                <div class="row-key">Status</div>
                <div class="row-val">Open to freelance work and internships!</div>
            </div>
            <div class="archive-row">
